{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Include the tenant in the sandbox pool key**\n\nThe pool is keyed only by function and qualifier, so invocations of the same `PER_TENANT` function for different tenants can reuse one worker and expose module globals or warm state across tenants. Key tenant-bearing invocations by `tenantId`, and add a counter test proving same-tenant reuse but cross-tenant separation.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75OsIk","finding_digest":"92bf619cbbd205885fbf72b46674bce5bc050d1fa8fd940db5fd6cfb85d31a67","finding_id":"arf_v1_sk7wdhf32icyqx57ok2gm5f44w","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs::invoke::tenant-sandbox-isolation","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs::invoke::tenant-sandbox-isolation","line":163,"observation_digest":"277620f6898a724240e617ce0154ccdcac2dba48f487fa5084490558d7f7eeba","observation_id":"aro_v1_e53cb5ujrjzeeqhgc7hacvgm3s","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-05T06:49:11Z","review_id":"arr_v1_42pxjmgykimp27isxjurdot2s5","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"ca059e59caba02cf5eb95f8a71ce6a65e951487a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":163,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_6njumhdjjdxtudbtv2sdxskyig","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T06:49:11Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
